WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:14.469
An alarming amounts of items in supermarkets
sold as reduced fat or healthy options are

00:00:14.469 --> 00:00:21.340
actually concealing unbelievable amounts of
hidden calories, fats, sugars and salt.

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:26.369
Here's some of the worst, so called "healthy"
foods.

00:00:26.369 --> 00:00:27.779
Prepared Salads

00:00:27.779 --> 00:00:29.340
"Salads", surely not!

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:35.960
Many pre-prepared salads sold in supermarkets
and restaurants actually contain more calories

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.620
than a Big Mac.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:42.801
Salad leaves, vegetables and fruits are incredibly
good for you, but it's the mayonnaise, salad

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:46.690
dressings and artificial flavourings that
pile on the pounds.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:54.719
An average shop bought chicken salad with
dressing contains 730 calories, 48 grams of

00:00:54.719 --> 00:01:00.149
fat and 1,280 milligrams of sodium.

00:01:00.149 --> 00:01:01.510
Want a healthy salad?

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:06.530
Make your own and drizzle a bit of rapeseed
oil and lemon juice over it.

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:08.039
Reduced fat peanut butter

00:01:08.039 --> 00:01:12.819
Believe it or not, you're much better off
eating normal peanut butter than the reduced

00:01:12.819 --> 00:01:14.289
fat variety.

00:01:14.289 --> 00:01:19.289
Reduced fat peanut butter and regular peanut
butter contain exactly the same amount of

00:01:19.289 --> 00:01:20.289
calories.

00:01:20.289 --> 00:01:25.450
However reduced fat peanut butter contains
a shedload of added sugar to supplement the

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:26.979
reduced fat.

00:01:26.979 --> 00:01:30.200
Sugar is much worse for you than natural peanut
fats.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:35.280
To produce reduced fat peanut butter, the
peanuts are stripped of all their natural

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.390
oils.

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:42.539
Peanut oils are fatty, but they contain good
monounsaturated fats, which actually have

00:01:42.539 --> 00:01:48.280
many health benefits such as reduced cholesterol
levels, lower risk of heart disease and general

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:49.280
weight loss.

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:54.489
Remove the fats and you remove all peanut
butter's health benefits.

00:01:54.489 --> 00:01:55.489
Granola

00:01:55.489 --> 00:02:00.170
Granola is a perfect example of bad food hiding
in healthy clothing.

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:04.810
You have to ask yourself, how can something
which tastes so good be healthy?

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:09.860
Granola is typically made with large amounts
of added sugar and fatty oils.

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:15.680
However oats are naturally good for you and
there are healthy brands of granola without

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:16.690
added sugar.

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:19.349
So check the ingredients before you buy.

00:02:19.349 --> 00:02:20.441
Vitamin Water/Flavoured Water

00:02:20.441 --> 00:02:28.900
Vitamin water may seem innocent on the surface
but it's basically hyped-up sugared water.

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:35.129
A bottle of Glaceau vitamin water contains
8 teaspoons of sugar, cleverly disguised on

00:02:35.129 --> 00:02:40.430
the label as "crystalline fructose", which
is basically a form of sugar.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:47.129
It also contains excessive amounts of citric
acid which can be unhealthy in large quantities

00:02:47.129 --> 00:02:49.200
and causes erosion of the teeth.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.909
Want a vitamin water that's really good for
you?

00:02:51.909 --> 00:02:54.420
Squeeze a lemon into a glass of water.

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:59.160
Lemons contain all the vitamins of vitamin
water, without the added sugar.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.390
Energy Bars/Cereal Bars

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:03.900
Energy bars are packed full of sugar.

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:10.090
Some energy bars actually contain more sugar
than a can of cola and others are almost one

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.749
third fat.

00:03:11.749 --> 00:03:16.670
Sure energy bars will provide you with quick
energy, because that's what sugar does, but

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:22.430
it will very quickly wear off and leave you
feeling more lethargic than you did before.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:28.310
Guess what, your body can only use so much
sugar at once, the rest of it is turned into

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:33.579
fatty acids and stored inside your body, piling
on the pounds.

00:03:33.579 --> 00:03:39.329
When you eat an energy bar, that's exactly
what happens to the majority of the sugars.

00:03:39.329 --> 00:03:40.329
Multigrain Foods

00:03:40.329 --> 00:03:46.499
Don't mistake multigrain for whole grain,
there's a very distinct difference.

00:03:46.499 --> 00:03:51.870
Wholegrain means the food contains all parts
of the grain, whereas multigrain means the

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:57.739
food contains different types of grain, although
none of them has to be wholegrain.

00:03:57.739 --> 00:04:01.709
Wholegrain foods are packed full of healthy
nutrients and fibre.

00:04:01.709 --> 00:04:07.810
Whereas multigrain foods don't necessarily
contain any healthy grains whatsoever.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:08.810
Smoothies

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:12.129
In small amounts, pure fruit smoothies are
very good for you.

00:04:12.129 --> 00:04:16.840
But many contain large amounts of added sugar,
ice cream or sherbet.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:20.570
Even pure fruit smoothies are bad for you
in large amounts.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:26.280
Fruits contain lots of natural sugars, which
are much better for you than refined sugar,

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:31.410
but even natural fruit sugars will put weight
on you, if you eat enough of them.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:36.530
Some smoothies served at smoothie bars clock
in at over 500 calories.

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:41.880
However smoothies contain numerous health
benefits because of all the beneficial vitamins

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:43.780
and minerals in fruit.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:49.010
Make your own smoothies using pure fruit and
water and stick to one small glass a day to

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:53.410
keep the weight off, whilst soaking up all
the benefits.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:55.170
Fat Free/Zero Calories

00:04:55.170 --> 00:05:00.340
Fat free versions of foods may seem great
at first glance, but you're actually better

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:02.900
off eating the full fat variant.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:09.590
Don't mistake "fat free" for calorie free,
fat free foods often contain more calories

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:11.230
than regular foods.

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:15.160
When you remove the fat from food you also
remove most of the taste.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:21.070
So to counter that, food manufacturers replace
the fat with sugars, sweeteners, thickeners

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:22.290
and salt.

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:25.120
These can all be much worse for you than fat.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:29.480
You see, it's not fat that's the problem,
it's the type of fat.

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:35.130
There are two types of unhealthy fats: saturated
fats and trans fats.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:42.180
Similarly there are two types of healthy fats:
monounsaturated fats and polyunsaturated fats.

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:48.740
Fat free foods are stripped of any healthy
fats they may have had and replaced with unhealthy

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.030
sugars and salts.

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:52.030
Diet Soda/Artificial Sweeteners

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:57.660
Studies at the University of Texas Health
Science Center have shown that the more diet

00:05:57.660 --> 00:06:02.750
soda a person drinks, the greater their chance
of becoming overweight.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:07.960
Diet sodas are packed full of artificial sweeteners
which disrupt the body's natural ability to

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:09.640
control calorie intake.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:17.060
The most commonly used are aspartame, cyclamate,
saccharin, acesulfame-k and sucralose.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:22.220
The list of negative effects afflicted from
artificial sweeteners is endless.

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:24.860
It has been strongly linked to depression.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:31.390
Individuals who drink diet soda are 30% more
likely to be diagnosed with depression in

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.000
their lifetimes.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:37.400
Artificial sweeteners, greatly increase the
risk of preterm delivery amongst pregnant

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:38.400
women.

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:44.900
But scariest of all, regular consumption of
diet soda increases your risk of type II diabetes

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:47.650
by 67%.

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:53.490
So next time you have a sugar craving, you're
much better off satisfying it with regular,

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:54.930
full-fat soda.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:07:00.470
The same applies to tea and coffee, it's actually
better for you to sweeten your drinks with

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:03.960
sugar than artificial sweeteners.

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:04.960
Sushi

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:12.060
Most sushi is made with white rice, but contains
very small amounts of the good stuff, A.K.A.

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:13.060
fish.

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:15.790
White rice is high-glycemic food.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:20.900
High-glycemic foods promote a rapid increase
in blood sugar and insulin levels, which is

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:24.140
followed by a very rapid drop in both.

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:29.840
This leads to a greatly increased appetite
which makes you crave junk food.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:36.100
Whilst sushi is not that unhealthy in a direct
sense it can easily lead to over eating.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:42.120
However some sushis do contain copious amounts
of added salt.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.120
Dried Fruit

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:47.920
Surely dried fruit is good for you, after
all it's just fruit.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:48.970
Think again.

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:54.400
Fruit is mostly water, remove the water and
you're left with pure sugar.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:08:00.600
This small amount of sugar isn't so bad when
you consume whole fruits, but when you eat

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:05.040
dried fruit you're eating a lot more sugar
per portion.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:12.090
A small handful of raisins contains 22 grams
of sugar.

